  ('ISO27001','a5-54','Sind Prozesse definiert, um Sicherheitsrisiken in der IKT-Lieferkette zu managen?','Are processes defined to manage security risks associated with the ICT supply chain?','{"coverage": "hub", "iso_ids": ["a5-54"], "risiko_ids": ["R-0091", "R-0452", "R-0459", "R-0471", "R-0472", "R-0473", "R-0487"], "n_risiken": 7}'::jsonb),
